id: reduce-pm-reduce-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T22:00:11.060Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T18:48:46.859Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T22:00:16.150Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T22:14:25.811Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 11/11, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-15T00:17:00.745Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 audit found release-copy remnants or package-level regression tests needing restoration. Keep the pinned caller and package hooks; remove obsolete local release orchestration and stale references, restore independent package behavior tests, and retarget mutation proofs to the caller contract. Run touched tests, unchanged coverage gates, typecheck and lint, then regenerate and check the changelog after final tracker writes. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread actions."
  "2026-11-15T00:58:57.848Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-reduce/pull/9: Retargeted the two stale release runtime reverts to the caller prepare-script input and package runtime capture hook. Kept the runtime ordering validator and all package behavior tests. Targeted tests passed 12/12. Full npm run coverage certification is delegated to exact-head CI at unchanged thresholds. npm run typecheck and npm run lint passed. Both runtime mutations fail their intended assertion; all five restored workflow tests pass in a disposable Git fixture. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker, keeping run artefacts outside this tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final tracker write. CI must verify the pushed head; no merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-19T09:00:35.937Z",codex-sol,Round DL updates README install instructions for the published package and verifies each documented archive path in a fresh consumer.
  "2026-11-19T09:43:55.149Z",codex-sol,"Round DL updated the registry and local archive instructions. npm run build && npm run build:test && node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/contracts.test.ts test/corpus-privacy.test.ts test/documentation.test.ts test/revert-seams.test.ts passed (24 passing, 0 skipped). npm run typecheck, npm run docstring and npm run test:install passed. All 1 README archive example(s) executed successfully in fresh consumers with the version produced by the source checkout. The changelog generation and check passed with tags fetched."
  "2026-11-19T18:40:52.914Z",codex-sol,"Repin Daily Release and the local pm-ops validator to v2026.11.19 using pm-case#23 as the model. Compare both caller contracts, inspect the protected candidate and npm publication history, and document the applicable post-merge dispatch. Verify the focused contracts, typecheck, lint, install acceptance, and generated changelog before pushing."
  "2026-11-19T18:43:34.699Z",codex-sol,"The v2026.11.14 and v2026.11.19 workflow-call input schemas match. The new restart job uses contents read and actions write within the existing caller permissions. pm-case#23 updates only the pm-ops dev dependency, so the matching validator and lockfile now use 2026.11.19. A read-only replay verified the archived handoff and three required checks on candidate #12. It returned occupied for the protected squash because npm already held 2026.11.6 before preparation. The explicit retirement replay refused the existing npm version. After merge, dispatch release.yml on current main with retire-unpublished=false."
  "2026-11-19T18:47:38.076Z",codex-sol,"Typecheck and 31 focused contracts passed. Lint, release publish attestation, changelog regeneration and check, and all 91 mutation proofs passed. Tracker health passed with an empty global PM configuration, isolating the package SDK from an optional global extension version skew. Production audit reported zero findings. The same dev-only glob advisory appears on the base and repin lockfiles and is tracked in reduce-dev-glob-audit."
  "2026-11-19T18:48:44.881Z",codex-sol,"npm run test:install passed the packed npm and Bun consumer journeys, Git-free CLI and SDK checks, and Node 22.19.0 and 26.13.0 runtime checks. Leave the rollout open for exact-head CI and the orchestrator post-merge dispatch. PR #20 also changes this rollout tracker item and history."
